START

Define production function:
    Production(x) = 10*x - x²

Set PSO parameters:
    Number of particles = 10
    Number of iterations = 20
    Inertia weight = 0.5
    Cognitive coefficient = 1.5
    Social coefficient = 1.5

Initialize each particle:
    Generate random position between 0 and 10
    Generate random velocity
    Set personal best position = current position
    Calculate personal best fitness

Find the global best particle

FOR each iteration:

    FOR each particle:

        Generate random values r1 and r2

        Update velocity:
            velocity =
                inertia × velocity
                + cognitive × r1 × (personal best - position)
                + social × r2 × (global best - position)

        Update position:
            position = position + velocity

        Keep position between 0 and 10

        Calculate current production

        IF current production > personal best production:
            Update personal best

        IF current production > global best production:
            Update global best

    END FOR

END FOR

Display global best position
Display global best production

STOP
